{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d284aa331809a392a71039dd9dc19a47d7daf0f197728c933ed5a8d589004524", "ja": "（『ゴールデンキャッスルライブ』を間近に控え、\n琴葉は気合い十分。ただ心配もあり……）", "zh": "（《黄金城堡演唱会》即将举行，琴叶干劲十足。不过，还是有些担心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "529be619077dc6ecc2324720f68d4d4efee239780db46091409aa3c7ac31169c", "ja": "「徳川四天王が一人、本多忠勝！　いざ参る！」\n……ううん、もっと力強く……。", "zh": "“德川四天王之一，本多忠胜！出阵！”\n……不对，还要更有力道一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b40c4adce26e33856ff009ac0d3afbb4377eaf6b177d92541e1e69ffd83a136a", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。こんな遅い時間まで自主練か。\n無理しすぎないようにな。", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。这么晚了还在自主练习啊。\n别太勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "850435569d92446da9e0e3b6ef0f549d6d5977225163d7a7d52100076552d440", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。武将の一人を任せて\nもらったからには、最大限の準備はしておきたくて。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。既然让我饰演一名武将，\n我就想做好最充分的准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "1f3c7bf63f953a44398d3fc70d4b824e7e20c75a3eb9a89d26a5f23360f6c9e3", "ja": "もし私が、かっこ悪く演じてしまったら、\n『本多忠勝』の名前に傷をつけてしまいますから。", "zh": "如果我演得不够帅气的话，\n就会给“本多忠胜”这个名字抹黑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b6f95ec5769c65f364762fd00f9c78d6b89cf94e09a80f146acbaf605c7b55f3", "ja": "傷を……ああ、本多忠勝の逸話だな。\n戦場で、一度も傷を負わなかったっていう。", "zh": "伤痕……啊，是本多忠胜的逸闻吧。听说他在战场上一次伤都没受过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "2c0caa8375168140a0cbcf55572928084332ab924b4a7e3532137054a5913685", "ja": "はい。意識しすぎかもしれませんけど……偉大な方の\n名前をお借りすることに、変わりはありませんから。", "zh": "是的。或许是我太在意了……但毕竟是借用了那位伟大之人的名字，不能不慎重对待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c597f5954c3b023b17090275050af27a0ae83d8a4a63df6363f41a2cf989590", "ja": "中途半端な向き合い方だけは、したくないんです。\n自分にできる精いっぱいで、取り組みたいなって。", "zh": "我不想以半吊子的态度去面对。想用自己能做到的全部力量，认真投入其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d0570eb5454e4e698b4995a8863bf6de1b5ff5e9dc1344faefa0c4284d0b21ec", "ja": "それだけ役と、真摯に向き合っているのはいいこと\nだと思うが。背負い過ぎも、それはそれで心配だよ。", "zh": "能这样认真地面对角色，我觉得是件好事。  \n不过，背负得太多的话，我也会担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "fb6b9c2a40718ee945bf5d9e85dde09a97d82b0194386859a30b2aeada9fa79f", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\nふふっ、でも大丈夫です。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。\n呵呵，不过没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "038e3eb62e5b53d8a64e276924920c650e23e490c0b4b40cf2b7ce792c7f74d5", "ja": "きっと……彼も同じだったはずですから。", "zh": "因为……他一定也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9b8d2ea4eae97f59bb7e04bc121d647714a95678b8ad6cde0efdc19837fe1a07", "ja": "同じ？", "zh": "一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "24d07b860e9c8ca784af0db2ded162068312dcf56e1722ff3f82c7dc18d55a4b", "ja": "はい。本多忠勝のことを調べていて、思ったんです。\nきっと、誰よりも努力していたんだろうなって。", "zh": "是的。我在查本多忠胜的资料时，就这么想了。\n他一定比任何人都更加努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "41c7d784b97fb8de201eccad6df2096e75538ce99f6cc24c9cbcebc6821278d1", "ja": "どんな戦場に立つことになっても大丈夫なように。\nもちろん、戦の才能もあったとは思いますけど。", "zh": "无论将来要站上怎样的战场，都要做好万全准备。\n当然，我想他应该也有战斗方面的才能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1014_p", "source_sha256": "09d8d88118b60caf31091dcb16ca25c897cdab3529f53f9bc45f0160e337c811", "ja": "なるほど……。琴葉はそう感じとったんだな。\n確かに。努力なくして、あの偉業は成し得ないよな。", "zh": "原来如此……琴叶是这么感受到的啊。\n确实。不付出努力，是不可能完成那项伟业的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "61383845d151cb33bf60fa72214e57d0f9e0fd852465d6c6cbb3a3a8756cf062", "ja": "はい……。だから、背負いすぎるくらいが\nちょうどいいと思うんです。", "zh": "是的……所以，我觉得哪怕背负得多到近乎过头，也正合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "57c11a02627964f98d146496cd415e36c5713962a3da37577e16ea0fe6596d05", "ja": "役に本気で向き合って、やっと本物に近づける。\n今は突き進むしかない！　そんな気がするんです。", "zh": "认真去面对角色，才终于能接近真实。\n现在只能勇往直前了！我就是有这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0743_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0743_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3fe2883f1a98303f0ab5927de50f907538e8f9449469e35254015d69b486dcff", "ja": "（力強く言い放つ言葉に、琴葉の覚悟を感じた。\n今の俺にできることは無理しないよう見守るだけだ！）", "zh": "（从她那番掷地有声的话语中，我感受到了琴叶的决心。\n现在的我能做的，只有守望着她，不让她太过勉强自己！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
